  "worldattribute-terraindiffusionHeightNoise": "Height noise",
  "worldattribute-terraindiffusionHeightNoise-desc": "Random height added to the large-scale map (about 8 km of real terrain per cell) before the detail is drawn, for more hills and hollows. 2 is about 100 m at 600 m elevation, more on mountains, none at the coast. 0 is off.",
